<h2>Where should the filters sit on the activity page?</h2>
<p class="subtitle">Event type (nine checkboxes), "Failed sign-ins only", and a date range. Wireframes only, not final styling.</p>

<div class="cards">
  <div class="card" data-choice="a" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="card-image">
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">A. Filter panel above the table</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p><strong>Account activity</strong></p>
          <div class="placeholder" style="text-align:left;padding:10px">
            <button class="mock-button">Failed sign-ins only</button>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <div><span class="label">Event type</span><br>
                [x] Sign-in &nbsp;[x] Sign-in failed &nbsp;[x] Sign-out<br>
                [x] Session expired &nbsp;[x] Password changed ...<br>(9 total)</div>
              <div><span class="label">Date range</span><br>
                <select class="mock-input"><option>Last 7 days</option></select><br>
                <input class="mock-input" placeholder="Start"> <input class="mock-input" placeholder="End"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px"><button class="mock-button">Apply filters</button> Clear all</div>
          </div>
          <p class="subtitle">Showing 12 of 48 events</p>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>A. Always-visible panel</h3>
      <p>Everything visible at once and works without JS as a GET form. Pushes the table down about 150px.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" data-choice="b" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="card-image">
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">B. Compact bar + "Filters" popover</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p><strong>Account activity</strong></p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <button class="mock-button">Failed sign-ins only</button>
            <select class="mock-input"><option>Last 90 days</option></select>
            <button class="mock-button">Filters (2)</button>
          </div>
          <div style="margin:6px 0">Active: <span class="mock-button" style="padding:2px 6px">Sign-in failed x</span> <span class="mock-button" style="padding:2px 6px">Password changed x</span></div>
          <div class="placeholder" style="text-align:left;padding:8px;margin-left:40%">Popover: event type checkboxes, custom dates, Apply</div>
          <p class="subtitle">Showing 12 of 48 events</p>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>B. Compact bar, details in popover</h3>
      <p>Table stays near the top; active filters shown as removable tags. Popover needs JS, so the no-JS fallback is a plain panel.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
